1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:07,780
When you are ready to take your profit or loss, close the trade.

2
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:11,610
Right click it and choose Close Position.

3
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:15,470
The window shows which position you are closing.

4
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:19,830
You can close all of it, or just part, by changing the amount.

5
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:23,790
Use current dealing rate closes at the live price.

6
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:29,630
Click OK to close it.

7
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:33,490
The trade is gone from your open positions.

8
00:00:33,590 --> 00:00:37,420
Open the Closed tab to see trades you have closed.

9
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:45,850
Pick how far back to look, for example 1 Month.

10
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:50,350
Each closed trade shows its open and close price and its final profit or loss.

